# UI hexagonal

Follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-hexagonal-ddd/SKILL.md`.

- Views render and emit events. They do not call `fetch` or embed sample rows.
- A hook performs one action and calls a use case. The view composes hooks.
- Domain and application do not import i18n. Adapters throw domain errors; hooks map them with `t()`.
- Sample data is an infrastructure adapter behind a port. Wire API use cases in `src/app/composition.ts`.
- Do not use parameter properties. `erasableSyntaxOnly` rejects them.
- Format money with `src/shared/domain/money.ts`.
- The seller id comes from the session.
